# The native submodules (ARCHITECTURE.md § 10, STACK.md "Native build layout").
#
# Two, and both are video quality metrics: XPSNR for the per-window score the search reads,
# libvmaf for the gate a replacement has to pass. The photo libraries — libjxl, jpegli, and
# the libheif fallback that was never uncommented — went with the photo path; see
# `archive/v1` if they are ever needed again.

[submodule "shared/native/xpsnr"]
	path = shared/native/xpsnr
	url = https://github.com/fraunhoferhhi/xpsnr.git
	shallow = true

[submodule "shared/native/vmaf"]
	path = shared/native/vmaf
	url = https://github.com/Netflix/vmaf.git
	shallow = true
